---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — AI Action Collective">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the collective</p>
    <h1>AI literacy for the people building a <em>better future.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Short videos, plain-language explainers, and tutorials that connect AI
      technology to the world you're fighting to build.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <div class="manifesto-block">
      <div class="manifesto-line">AI is <strong>built on collective knowledge.</strong></div>
      <div class="manifesto-line">Its benefits should be <strong>shared collectively.</strong></div>
      <div class="manifesto-line">That future doesn't happen <strong>automatically.</strong></div>
      <div class="manifesto-line">It happens when <strong>organizers understand the tools.</strong></div>
    </div>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      AI Action Collective is a community directory of AI literacy content for the
      progressive movement — made by many creators and organized by subject, from
      the basics of how AI works to the policy fights that will shape who benefits
      from it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every piece of content links directly to its creator, with full attribution.
      Some entries are submitted by their creators; others are curated picks our
      reviewers added because they're too good not to share. If we've listed your
      work and you'd like anything changed — or removed — just
      <a href="mailto:aiactioncollective@gmail.com">email us</a> and we'll take care
      of it right away.
    </p>

    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="font-style: italic;">
      "In service of a future with more health, wealth, and well-being for everyone."
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe AI, built on all of our collective knowledge, is a collective
      resource — and that its gains should be broadly shared. Getting there takes
      organizers, campaigners, and everyday people who understand the technology
      well enough to shape where it goes.
    </p>

    <h2>Add your voice</h2>
    <p>
      Made something that fits? Videos, posts, guides, tutorials —
      <a href="/submit">submit it to the directory</a>. A human reviews every
      submission, and we'll email you either way.
    </p>
    <p>
      Want to hear when new things launch?
      <a href="mailto:aiactioncollective@gmail.com?subject=Keep%20me%20in%20the%20loop">Stay in the loop.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
